# Normalise line endings in this repository, while each machine keeps its own working copy in
# the form it prefers. Types listed below are the ones actually tracked here.

* text=auto

# ---------- Text ----------

*.xml    text
*.cs     text diff=csharp
*.md     text
*.csproj text
*.props  text
*.js     text
*.json   text
*.ps1    text
*.scm    text

# ---------- Binaries: neither normalised nor diffed as text ----------

*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
